            <title>0.18.12</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 23:42:42 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.18.12</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.12</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.12</h2>
<ul>
<li>**Starter menus** — a fresh install now comes set up: the main menu&#x27;s second layer (press 2) holds snippets, a copy-to-Notes macro, New Note, Calculator, Downloads, Wi-Fi, Do Not Disturb and Empty Trash; the Clipboard folder gains Emoji</li>
<li>**App menus out of the box** — a ⌥ Option tap in Safari, Finder, Mail, Notes, Messages, Music or Preview opens that app&#x27;s eight most-used commands, with the app&#x27;s own keys</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
